  "job_B17.2_20251003_114404": {
    "chunk_text": "On \u00feison geare w\u00e6s sancte Dunstan geboren. And he leofode LXIII geare and on \u00feam LXIIII geare he for\u00f0ferde XIIII kalendas Jun. Her for\u00f0ferde sancte Dunstan arcebiscop. Her Siric biscop for to Rome. Her Siric arcebiscop for\u00f0ferde. Her \u00c6lfric biscop for to Rome. Her for\u00f0ferde \u00c6lfric biscop. Her \u00c6lfeh biscop for to Rome. Her w\u00e6s Cantwarabyrig gewunnan. Her w\u00e6s sancte \u00c6lfeh gemartyrod. Her for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelred kyng. Her w\u00e6s Cnut gecoran to kynge. Her for\u00f0ferde Lyfing arcebiscop and \u00c6gelno\u00f0 decanus feng to \u00fean biscoprice. Her for \u00c6gelno\u00fe biscop to Rome. Her w\u00e6s sancte \u00c6lfeh gefered of lundene to Cristes cyrcian. Her for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelwine decanus. Her for\u00f0ferde Cnut kyng. Her for\u00f0ferde \u00c6gelno\u00f0 arcebiscop and Eadsige biscop feng to biscoprice. Her Eadsige biscop for to Rome and Harold kyng for\u00f0ferde. Her for\u00f0ferde Har\u00f0acnut kyng. Her w\u00e6s Eaweard gehalgod to kynge. Her for\u00f0ferde Eadsige arcebiscop and Rodbert feng to biscoprice. Her for\u00f0ferde Godwine eorl. Her Benedictus papa sende Stigande \u00feone pallium. Her for\u00f0ferde Godwine biscop and Wulfric abbod. Her for\u00f0ferde Eadward kyng and her com Willelm. Her on \u00feison geare barn Cristes cyrce. On \u00feison geare com Landfranc abbod and hine man halgode to bisceope to Cristes cyrcian. Her Landfranc arcebiscop sta\u00f0olede Cristes cyrican V id Apl. On \u00feison geare man sloh W\u00e6l\u00feeof II k Jun. On \ufffd",
